1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,470
Drinking iced water...

2
00:00:01,470 --> 00:00:02,655
makes you fat?

3
00:00:02,655 --> 00:00:03,563
Myth...

4
00:00:03,563 --> 00:00:04,558
or fact?

5
00:00:05,772 --> 00:00:07,442
The answer...

6
00:00:07,442 --> 00:00:08,183
MYTH!

7
00:00:08,183 --> 00:00:09,022
Iced water has

8
00:00:09,022 --> 00:00:10,415
zero calories!

9
00:00:10,415 --> 00:00:12,049
But there's a real culprit...

10
00:00:12,049 --> 00:00:13,743
at the end of the video.

11
00:00:13,743 --> 00:00:15,427
In fact, it's the opposite:

12
00:00:15,427 --> 00:00:17,473
iced water is about 4°C.

13
00:00:17,473 --> 00:00:18,420
Your body has to warm it

14
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,927
up to 37°C.

15
00:00:19,927 --> 00:00:20,957
That takes energy:

16
00:00:20,957 --> 00:00:22,115
about 16 calories

17
00:00:22,115 --> 00:00:23,272
per half liter!

18
00:00:23,272 --> 00:00:24,700
Tiny, sure,

19
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,710
but it clearly won't make you fat.

20
00:00:27,088 --> 00:00:28,452
So, who's the culprit?

21
00:00:28,452 --> 00:00:29,258
SUGAR!

22
00:00:29,258 --> 00:00:31,282
Plain iced water: zero calories.

23
00:00:31,282 --> 00:00:33,606
Sweet iced tea with two spoons of sugar:

24
00:00:33,606 --> 00:00:35,208
about 100 calories!

25
00:00:35,208 --> 00:00:36,282
And the daily sugar limit

26
00:00:36,282 --> 00:00:38,404
is just 4 tablespoons.

27
00:00:38,404 --> 00:00:39,725
So, iced water?

28
00:00:39,725 --> 00:00:41,614
Safe, as long as it's plain!

29
00:00:41,614 --> 00:00:42,661
Send this to a friend

30
00:00:42,661 --> 00:00:45,185
who's still scared of ice!

